    "Каждое задание нужно подтвердить фотографией. Выключите, чтобы отмечать без фото.": {
      "comment": "Text displayed in a settings row that allows the user to toggle whether to require photos for completed habits.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every task must be confirmed with a photo. Turn this off to check tasks off without a photo."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
